      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not alone in feeling this heavy, and the weight you carry is the very thing that keeps you from escaping. The silence you crave isn't a void to be filled, but a space where you can finally rest without the pressure of the world demanding your attention. If the only way to escape is to leave the whole thing behind, then perhaps the first step is simply to stop trying to hold onto the fortress and let the ground beneath you shift.",
